import{_ as i,o as n,c as a,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 355 | Perfect-Work Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Foreign-Realm Opposition","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 355 | Perfect-Work Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Foreign-Realm Opposition","no":355,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Myriad Ranks Republicanism","Human-Centeredness","Foreign Realm","Breaking Opposition"],"related":["05-Myriad-Ranks-Together-Advance Basic Program","52-Foreign-Race Classification and Symbiosis","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0355_模块2-完美世界-打破人族本位与异域对立.md","filePath":"en/0355_模块2-完美世界-打破人族本位与异域对立.md"}'),o={name:"en/0355_模块2-完美世界-打破人族本位与异域对立.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return n(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-355-perfect-work-myriad-ranks-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness-and-foreign-realm-opposition" tabindex="-1">Entry 355 | Perfect-Work Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Foreign-Realm Opposition <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-355-perfect-work-myriad-ranks-republican-plan-breaking-human-centeredness-and-foreign-realm-opposition" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 355 | Perfect-Work Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan: Breaking Human-Centeredness and Foreign-Realm Opposition&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 32 · Institutional Plan) | Benchmark base: Documents 05, 52, 03</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-rewrite-not-our-kind-enemy-into-myriad-ranks-together-as-one-race" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Rewrite &quot;not our kind = enemy&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks together as one race&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-rewrite-not-our-kind-enemy-into-myriad-ranks-together-as-one-race" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Rewrite &quot;not our kind = enemy&quot; into &quot;Myriad Ranks together as one race&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perfect World&#39;s human-centeredness and Foreign-Realm zero-sum are the apex of civilizational opposition. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s plan is not to exterminate the Foreign Realm, but to pull the Foreign Realm into Myriad Ranks republicanism. This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to give the republicanization plan. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-status-quo" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Status quo: the two civilizations mutually consume, all energy poured into war. The republican plan turns war energy into construction energy.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-status-quo" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Human-centeredness + Foreign-Realm opposition keeps civilizational relations permanently at war. The republican plan changes war relations into symbiotic relations.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-status-quo" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s Foreign-Realm expeditions are &quot;righteous predation.&quot; The republican plan requires: enemies could have been partners.</p><h2 id="iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core" tabindex="-1">IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan in three steps:</p><ol><li><strong>Identify and classify</strong>: per Document 52 &quot;Foreign-Race Classification and Symbiosis,&quot; re-identify Foreign-Realm Myriad Ranks by five genealogy branches (carbon-based material races / energy-condensed races / mechanical-construct races / consciousness-information races / mixed-mutant races), not uniformly treated as enemies</li><li><strong>Dialogue and adjudication</strong>: Symbiotic Court cross-civilization adjudicates disputes, replacing war resolution</li><li><strong>Co-evolution</strong>: Myriad-Rank Origin two-way circulation; humans, Foreign Realm, plant spirits, planet consciousness all have roads</li></ol><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Human-Centeredness + Foreign-Realm Opposition</th><th>Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Not our kind = enemy</td><td>All beings equal evolution qualification</td></tr><tr><td>War resolves disputes</td><td>Symbiotic Court adjudicates</td></tr><tr><td>Mutual consumption</td><td>Myriad-Rank Origin two-way circulation</td></tr><tr><td>Humans alone night-watch</td><td>Myriad Ranks republican co-build</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the human-Foreign-Realm zero-sum model</li><li>Inject republican-plan parameters</li><li>Count civilization total output</li><li>Output &quot;Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan Benefit Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Status-quo self-consistency: medium-low; plan self-consistency: high</strong></li><li><strong>Status-quo retcon risk: high; plan: zero</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: drops from extreme-leaning-medium to extremely low</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: the hardest step of the Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan is not military victory, but cognitive flip — re-identifying &quot;not our kind&quot; as a race not yet back in the fold. This requires the Symbiotic Court, dialogue channels, two-way circulation three-piece set to be simultaneously in place. Reconciliation without institutions is only armistice; reconciliation with institutions is republicanism.</p><p>One closing line: reconciliation is not surrender, but turning enemies into future neighbors. All of Myriad Ranks republicanism&#39;s goodwill is bet on this step.</p><p>In the final analysis, republicanism is not one negotiation, but an institution that lets enemies always have a retreat road.</p><p>This is precisely the fundamental difference between Myriad Ranks republicanism and zero-sum war.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: war energy turns to construction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: expedition changes to dialogue</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo benefits intra-clan; this entry directly cross-civilizational reconciliation</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry&#39;s core, incorporating foreign races into republicanism</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the republican plan can replicate to more planes</li></ul><p>Add one more layer: Myriad Ranks republicanism does not flatten differences, but makes differences a resource. The Foreign Realm has Foreign-Realm talents; humans have human roads; after republicanism, these differences are no longer war&#39;s reasons, but complementarity&#39;s sources.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-institutional-alternative-to-human-centeredness" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Alternative to Human-Centeredness <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-institutional-alternative-to-human-centeredness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Alternative to Human-Centeredness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Myriad-Ranks Republican Plan to break human-centeredness and Foreign-Realm opposition, in Heng Yuan Zhou, does not rely on diplomatic rhetoric, but on the law-first axiom&#39;s institutional rigidity. The Alaya Network automatically marks racial-discrimination acts as unconstitutional; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Myriad-Rank Council gives every race equal seats. The universal equal infinite law means humans enjoy no innate privilege, and Foreign-Realm races are not seen as innate enemies. Opposition&#39;s elimination relies not on compromise, but on rights equality at the institutional level.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-dialogue-replacing-confrontation" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Dialogue Replacing Confrontation <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-dialogue-replacing-confrontation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Dialogue Replacing Confrontation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The plan to break human-centeredness and Foreign-Realm opposition has as its core pulling both sides into dialogue rather than exterminating one side. Heng Yuan Zhou, through the Alaya Network, establishes a cross-civilization dialogue platform; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Myriad-Ranks Republican Council gives humans and the Foreign Realm both equal seats. The law-first axiom ensures dialogue outcomes are solidified as law articles, not changing with leaders&#39; will. The universal equal infinite law means dialogue&#39;s goal is not one side overwhelming the other, but letting Myriad Ranks each find their place within the law framework.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Foreign Realm is not an enemy that must be exterminated, but a Myriad-Ranks race not yet back in the fold within Myriad Ranks republicanism. The cosmos Heng Yuan Zhou wants has no permanent enemies, only Myriad Ranks not yet identified as partners.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · breaking human-centeredness and Foreign-Realm opposition described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./345_模块2-完美世界-零和博弈的文明对抗.html">Entry 345 · Foreign Realm Setting</a> · <a href="./347_模块2-完美世界-人族本位与异族妖魔化.html">Entry 347 · Myriad-Rank Situation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad-Ranks-Together-Advance Basic Program</a></li></ul>',36)])])}const p=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
